# This project uses AWS Textract and AWS Bedrock.
# Configure your AWS credentials via the AWS CLI (`aws configure`) --
# this project does not read credentials from environment variables directly,
# it relies on boto3's default credential chain (AWS CLI profile, IAM role, etc.)

# Required AWS permissions:
# - textract:AnalyzeDocument
# - bedrock:InvokeModel (for the Claude model specified in src/classification.py
#   and src/extraction.py)

# Region used: us-east-1 (change in src/classification.py and src/extraction.py
# if your Bedrock model access is in a different region)
